        <mxCell id="-Su9fhEuCYk5Z8fKa3G5-9" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;backend-ci.yml : job &quot;backend-check&quot;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Checkout&amp;nbsp;(actions/checkout@v4)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Setup Python 3.11&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Write CI-only backend/.env&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. docker compose up db redis backend&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. Install deps (pip, ruff, pytest-cov)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. Ruff lint&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. Pytest unit tests -&amp;gt; artifact: unit-coverage.xml&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;8. Wait for /v1/health&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;9. Pytest integration tests -&amp;gt; artifact: int-coverage.xml&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;10. Tear down containers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;11. Upload coverage -&amp;gt; Codecov&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;12. &amp;nbsp;Build image (Buildx) -&amp;gt; discarded after job&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
